{
  "pack": {
    "pack_format": 48,
    "description": "PlanetaryFactory: cuts Terra's ore to iron, copper, coal and uranium"
  },
  "filter": {
    "block": [
      {
        "namespace": "gtceu",
        "path": "^gtceu/ore_vein/apatite\\.json"
      },
      {
        "namespace": "gtceu",
        "path": "^gtceu/ore_vein/cassiterite\\.json"
      },
      {
        "namespace": "gtceu",
        "path": "^gtceu/ore_vein/copper_tin\\.json"
      },
      {
        "namespace": "gtceu",
        "path": "^gtceu/ore_vein/diamond\\.json"
      },
      {
        "namespace": "gtceu",
        "path": "^gtceu/ore_vein/galena\\.json"
      },
      {
        "namespace": "gtceu",
        "path": "^gtceu/ore_vein/garnet\\.json"
      },
      {
        "namespace": "gtceu",
        "path": "^gtceu/ore_vein/garnet_tin\\.json"
      },
      {
        "namespace": "gtceu",
        "path": "^gtceu/ore_vein/lapis\\.json"
      },
      {
        "namespace": "gtceu",
        "path": "^gtceu/ore_vein/lubricant\\.json"
      },
      {
        "namespace": "gtceu",
        "path": "^gtceu/ore_vein/magnetite\\.json"
      },
      {
        "namespace": "gtceu",
        "path": "^gtceu/ore_vein/manganese\\.json"
      },
      {
        "namespace": "gtceu",
        "path": "^gtceu/ore_vein/mica\\.json"
      },
      {
        "namespace": "gtceu",
        "path": "^gtceu/ore_vein/mineral_sand\\.json"
      },
      {
        "namespace": "gtceu",
        "path": "^gtceu/ore_vein/nickel\\.json"
      },
      {
        "namespace": "gtceu",
        "path": "^gtceu/ore_vein/oilsands\\.json"
      },
      {
        "namespace": "gtceu",
        "path": "^gtceu/ore_vein/olivine\\.json"
      },
      {
        "namespace": "gtceu",
        "path": "^gtceu/ore_vein/redstone\\.json"
      },
      {
        "namespace": "gtceu",
        "path": "^gtceu/ore_vein/salts\\.json"
      },
      {
        "namespace": "gtceu",
        "path": "^gtceu/ore_vein/sapphire\\.json"
      }
    ]
  },
  "_comment": [
    "ADR-0021 restricts Terra to Nauvis's resources. The kubejs/data overrides for",
    "these veins are deleted rather than emptied, so this pack blocks the mod's own",
    "files -- an emptied override would still register a vein with zero weight.",
    "gtceu:uranium is a pack vein, not a mod one, so nothing here touches it."
  ]
}
